# The Claude plugin's environment: Anthropic's Python SDK, which the worker
# talks to Claude's service through - nothing else. Set up only when the
# plugin is added (docs/PLUGINS.md).
# Locked for every platform, with hashes, by:
#   uv pip compile --universal --python-version 3.12 --generate-hashes requirements.in -o requirements.lock
